  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1177</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to _______.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "24",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now on solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now on using by parts integration we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo><msubsup><menclose notation=\"right\"><mi>x</mi></menclose><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>-</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>as&#160;</mtext><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mtext>Given&#160;</mtext><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1177</mn><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1177</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1176</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>1176</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><msqrt><mn>9409</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>97</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>49</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>But given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>N</mi></math>&nbsp;so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
